  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_001 (RNA-only, singleprofile, PCA encoder) achieves 0.4849 validation accuracy. This experiment tests multiprofile (profile_setting=multiprofile) with avgpool aggregation, isolating the effect of profile setting and aggregation. It balances exploration (testing multiprofile) and exploitation (using the same RNA encoder and no image encoder). Multiprofile could capture more complex patterns, and avgpool is a simple aggregation method to assess its impact without introducing complexity from fusion or image encoders."
